resence.\n\n## Artifact Paths\n\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-rag-read-model-projection-contract.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-rag-read-model-projection-fixtures.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-rag-read-model-projection-contract.readback.md\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-rag-read-model-projection-contract.validator-result.json\n- scripts/supabase/build-kg-rag-read-model-projection-contract.mjs\n- scripts/supabase/__tests__/kg-rag-read-model-projection-contract.test.js\n\n## Counts\n\n- Source question rows: 3530\n- Read-model row-presence included rows: 3530\n- RAG projection included rows: 2672\n- RAG projection downgraded rows: 159\n- RAG projection excluded rows: 699\n- RAG projection candidate-only rows: 0\n- Rights/display blocked rows: 3530\n- Student display eligible rows: 0\n- Method confidence blocks question presence rows: 0\n- Validator checks: 12 pass, 0 fail\n\n## Verification\n\n- PASS: git fetch origin main && git rev-parse origin/main -> edc0251f747d2f08733e409fb267bb2134b11c19\n- PASS: npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json -> warning only for staged worktree/no upstream before push; branch safety, artifact guard, and ratchet healthy\n- PASS: gh issue view 1291 --repo Samsen879/ciecopilot-home --json number,title,state,body,comments,url\n- PASS: gh issue view 1278 --repo Samsen879/ciecopilot-home --json number,title,state,body,comments,url\n- PASS: node scripts/supabase/build-kg-rag-read-model-projection-contract.mjs --json -> validator status pass\n- PASS: npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/supabase/__tests__/kg-rag-read-model-projection-contract.test.js -> 5 tests passed\n- PASS: npx eslint scripts/supabase/build-kg-rag-read-model-projection-contract.mjs scripts/supabase/__tests__/kg-rag-read-model-projection-contract.test.js\n- PASS: git diff --check --cached\n\n## PR Metadata\n\n- PR number: #1308\n- Head SHA: d9f727459ce5e80c3ae57e8a64b0338d3c578ac5\n\n## Blockers\n\n- None.\n\n## Non-Goals Preserved\n\n- No production RAG reindex.\n- No vector store mutation.\n- No frontend UI/routes.\n- No remote Supabase mutation.\n- No served-subset gating revival; all 3530 question rows remain read-model row-presence scope.\n","created_at":"2026-07-05T13:41:41Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T13:45:18Z","closed_at":"2026-07-05T13:45:16Z","merged_at":"2026-07-05T13:45:16Z","merge_commit_sha":"0fd27836f674b941b63dfb6c2db658b49c6c7846","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1308/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1308/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1308/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/d9f727459ce5e80c3ae57e8a64b0338d3c578ac5","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1291-kg-rag-read-model-projection-contract","ref":"task/1291-kg-rag-read-model-projection-contract","sha":"d9f727459ce5e80c3ae57e8a64b0338d3c578ac5","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.gith